    "Deletes what is older than the periods above right now. Whimbrel may then compact the database to give space back." : {
      "comment" : "Help under the Apply Retention Now row in Settings.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Löscht jetzt, was älter als die obigen Fristen ist. Danach kann Whimbrel die Datenbank verdichten, um Platz freizugeben."
          }
        },
